title: Start
---
<<declare $coins = 7>>
<<declare $hasLantern = false>>
Hawker: Night market's open. A lantern's 3 coins — the alleys are black as pitch.
-> Buy the lantern
    <<if $coins >= 3>>
        <<set $coins = $coins - 3>>
        <<set $hasLantern = true>>
        Hawker: Mind the step past the tea house. The lantern will hold till dawn.
        <<jump Alleys>>
    <<else>>
        Hawker: Come back with 3 coins, friend.
    <<endif>>
-> Keep walking
    Narrator: You keep to the dark. The alleys keep their secrets.
===

title: Alleys
---
Narrator: Paper windows glow along the lane. You carry a lit lantern and {$coins} coins, and light enough to spend one on.
===
